  "plot_summary": "The FF are talking about what Johnny is reading in the newspaper about the X-Men fighting the Brotherhood of Evil Mutants, Johnny being particularly interested in Iceman.&nbsp; But he heads out for his date with Doris - they're taking a boat ride around Manhattan Island, little knowing that Bobby Drake/Iceman is planning the exact same thing (sans date).\n\nOn board, Bobby approaches Doris, not realizing she's with Johnny, who then shows up.&nbsp; Bobby realizes he's met the Human Torch and storms off, accidently bumping into a couple of crooks working for a pirate named Captain Barracuda (complete with eye patch), who take out the ship's radio so that their boss can come aboard.&nbsp; They want wallets and jewels of course.&nbsp; Soon, both the Human Torch and Iceman spring into action!\n\nBut Barracuda is clever and finds ways to use their powers against them, first Iceman, then the Torch, who inadvertently starts a fire on board, putting everyone at risk.&nbsp; Iceman helps here, but when Johnny rounds up the henchmen, Barracuda grabs Dorrie and heads out on a launch, Iceman freezes the water around him, and he's trapped.&nbsp; Bobby senses he'd better scram and walks back to shore on an icy path.&nbsp; Johnny wishes he'd hung around long enough to offer thanks.",
  "grade_one_liner": "FIXME - write something",
  "subtitle": "FIXME - write something",
  "review_text": "A largely by-the-book first meeting between two of Marvel's teenage heroes, apparently requested by many readers, so this was in response.&nbsp; The introduction of Captain Barracuda was a nice addition, and I know we'll be seeing him again a few times.&nbsp; He didn't panic when he realized he was up against two super-powered defenders of the ship and used his brain to outwit them, despite it ultimately being in a losing effort.\n\nThere was nothing really bad in this offering, but it hardly will rise to the top of anyone's top-100 list either.&nbsp; It was nice to see them together.&nbsp; I don't know how many times they team up in the years ahead.&nbsp; I'm pretty sure the X-Men guest star in the FF coming up soon, and the pair also share a <i>Marvel Team-Up</i> issue against Equinox years later, but as for other appearances together, I guess we'll see...\n\n\n[BOTTOM_LINE]\n<b>FIXME</b>",
  "highlight": "FIXME - write something"
